+Built from:   fix/day1-regressions-printer-sse-backup → main @ 7e8de542e263d4562d8b79fb84491d1c07409d3f (PR #22)
+Promoted:     2026-05-08 — DMG v16-fix passed user hardware test of all 4 Day-1 fixes
+Build env:    Node v24.15.0, Electron 41.3.0
+better-sqlite3: 12.9.0 (NMV 145, prebuilds for darwin-arm64 + win32-x64)
+extraResources overlay: verified — Lesson 28 fix in place
+
+Canonical artifacts (top-level)
+-------------------------------
+OpsControl-Server-v1.5.1-mac-arm64.dmg   166 MB   Mac arm64 SERVER variant (PR #22 fixes)
+OpsControl-Client-v1.5.1-mac-arm64.dmg   166 MB   Mac arm64 CLIENT variant (PR #22 fixes)
+
+SHA256:
+  Server  798e0959369becdd43006f24942354991a7fb403f26ef488d62a9f3146bcf1d0
+  Client  b13ee422d400457dc2c2178dc02a1712f41e77f14ac602444027c71ed0410b31
+
+Each installer ships its own role manifest (build-role.json) that the runtime reads to
+choose embedded-server vs thin-client behavior — no env-var configuration needed.
+
+Archived builds (releases/v1.5.1/archive/)
+------------------------------------------
+v14-{Server,Client}.{dmg,exe}        Phase 2 Day 1 initial build (main @ ccf49fe)
+                                     — PRE-DAY-1-HARDWARE-FIX. Has the 4 macOS bugs
+                                       that PR #22 fixed (printer.list, SSE 401,
+                                       backup path inside .app, verifyBackup basename).
+                                     — Windows EXEs unaffected; can ship if needed.
+
+v15-fix/                             Intermediate Mac DMG with 3-of-4 fixes
+                                     (printer + SSE + cosmetic backup path).
+                                     Hardware test on this revealed the
+                                     verifyBackup deeper bug — not shipped.
+
+v16-fix-README.txt                   Original README from v16-fix/ folder before promotion
+v16-fix-SHA256SUMS.txt               Original v16-fix checksums file before promotion
+
+Why v14 isn't the canonical Mac DMG
+-----------------------------------
+Phase 2 Day 1 hardware test on v14 surfaced 4 pre-existing macOS bugs (printer
+"OS not supported", SSE HTTP 401, backup path inside read-only .app bundle,
+backup cycle "unable to open database file"). PR #22 (SHA: `7e8de54`) shipped
+all 4 fixes and DMG v16 passes the full hardware test. v16 is therefore the
+canonical Mac shipment for v1.5.1.
+
+Windows EXEs were not rebuilt for the day-1 fixes because:
+  - Bug A (printer.list): only the macOS branch needed adding; Windows path unchanged
+  - Bug B (SSE 401): server-side fix; Windows EXE re-uses the same server bundle
+  - Bug C+D (backup paths): server-side fix; same server bundle
+A Windows rebuild from PR #22 SHA can be produced when needed — see
+DEPLOYMENT.md §4 for the build steps. The v14 Windows EXEs in archive/ have
+the OLD (broken) server bundle; do NOT ship them as canonical Windows artifacts.
+
+Lesson 28 verification (canonical Mac DMGs)
+-------------------------------------------
+Both DMGs:
+  app/node_modules/better-sqlite3/.../better_sqlite3.node           e8c5e5e4...da5eb1
+  app.asar.unpacked/node_modules/better-sqlite3/.../better_sqlite3.node  e8c5e5e4...da5eb1
+  → IDENTICAL — embedded server resolves the correct NMV 145 binary
+
