+  #23  Lesson 30 + sprint history + FIX-21 ticket    4abfc45  (docs only)
+
+Distribution targets
+--------------------
+Mac admin / sales / quality operators:
+  open OpsControl-Client-v1.5.1-mac-arm64.dmg → drag .app to /Applications → launch.
+  Per-machine smart-client wizard runs on first start.
