+
+Production server (remote Windows at 10.102.3.61):
+  This is a Node.js Express server running directly — NOT a packaged Electron app.
+  Deploy via deploy.ps1 from the repo (see CLAUDE.md "Deployment topology" + the
+  releases/v1.5.1/DEPLOYMENT.md runbook).
